        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 2, Glenveagh Court, Letterkenny – €189,000\r\n\r\nCiaran Byrne Estate Agents Team KW Donegal are delighted to present this modern 2-bedroom (1 ensuite) apartment with balcony in this sought-after development in the heart of Letterkenny.\r\n\r\nWell-presented and spacious 2-bedroom apartment ideally located within walking distance of all local amenities including shops, schools, restaurants, and leisure facilities, making it an ideal purchase for first-time buyers or investors.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes:\r\n\r\nEntrance hallway with timber flooring and storage cupboard. Bright open-plan kitchen/dining/living area (16.7ft x 16.10ft) with a mix of timber and tiled flooring, fitted kitchen units, and integrated appliances (oven, hob, washing machine, dishwasher, fridge/freezer).\r\nSliding patio doors lead to a private balcony with paved flooring and glass surround, enjoying views over Letterkenny town.\r\nTwo bedrooms including a spacious main bedroom (12.10ft x 11ft) with ensuite (fully tiled shower cubicle, mains shower). Second bedroom (10.5ft x 8.1ft). Main bathroom with tiled flooring and bath with overhead shower.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n2 Bedrooms (1 Ensuite)\r\nPrivate balcony with town views\r\nElectric storage heating\r\nLift access to all floors\r\nFully managed development\r\nManagement Fee: Approx. €1,500 per annum (includes block insurance, refuse & maintenance)\r\nPrice: €189,000\r\nIdeal starter home or investment opportunity in an excellent central location.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
